{{also|Fernsehen}}
==German==

===Etymology===
Compound of {{compound|fern|sehen|lang=de}}, derived from the noun {{m|de|Fernsehen}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfɛʁnˌzeː.ən/|lang=de}} {{a|official standard, but rare}}
* {{IPA|/ˈfɛʁnˌzeːn/|[ˈfɛʁnˌzeːn]|[ˈfɛɐ̯nˌzeːn]|lang=de}} {{a|normal}}
* {{audio|De-Fernsehen.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Fernsehen.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=5|sieht fern|sah fern|ferngesehen|past subjunctive=sähe fern}}

# to watch [[television]]

====Usage notes====
''Fernsehen'' {{m|de|kucken}} or ''Fernsehen'' {{m|de|schauen}} are more common in spoken German. Since these constructions may be considered [[tautological]], formal German prefers the verb ''fernsehen''.

